            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "V3 · DISPATCH HEADS, DATA BODIES — one rule decides the lane. The heading band carries what chooses WHICH CODE RUNS. The body carries what that code RUNS ON. Same grammar, two different answers below."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
